{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Include timezone state in the retained-size budget.** Exact `datetime.datetime` and `datetime.time` values retain their `tzinfo`, and a custom `tzinfo` may own arbitrarily large state. Charging only the datetime's shallow size allows a transformed value backed by a payload larger than 16 MB to remain pending or in flight. Traverse `tzinfo` explicitly, or reject custom timezone instances, and add an over-budget custom-renderer test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s8LLa","finding_digest":"ea6c1cf3405a9df9ac9ecf0e969171cbe08e51ef48754894a52ee1a6db3c26bc","finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","line":76,"observation_digest":"48a2aac67ecbd98b5750c1d1a3a1208c8aedaf2b279adbcd94ef13b57985d370","observation_id":"aro_v1_jcrkvrt6zpmywv2qyhi2hijars","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","published_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aazv6mtkt4toiyvp5s2wmlz7z4","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"7b5c6a3383009fd90a86136b6e2622d45636fa24","reviewer":"codex","start_line":75,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_hmejsf4kel7jtra7cudp4r3553","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T03:33:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
